Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why is this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.63,0:00:01.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,giant bridge spinning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:02.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,above a railway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.89,0:00:03.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:04.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,bridge in China
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:05.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,that was built
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:06.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:07.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Trains can't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.67,0:00:08.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,for long so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:09.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,it's built first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and turned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.01,0:00:10.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:11.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,The whole bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:12.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,sits on one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.59,0:00:13.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,giant ball joint
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:14.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,in its pier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,It weighs forty-six
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:16.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,thousand tons and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:17.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,is almost nine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:18.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,hundred feet long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:19.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then it slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:20.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,turns on that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:20.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,one joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.22,0:00:22.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,It swung fifty-two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:23.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,degrees in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.03,0:00:24.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,sixty-eight minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:25.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's about eight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:26.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,times slower than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:26.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,a clock's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:27.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,minute hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:28.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,The railway gave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:29.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,the builders a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.47,0:00:30.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,window of under
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:31.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:32.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,And trains were
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,rolling underneath again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:34.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,soon after.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:35.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's why some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:36.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,bridges in China
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.21,0:00:37.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,are built sideways
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:38.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,and then spun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:38.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,into place.
